      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثِيرٌ</span></b>  <i>A covering of</i> [or <i>film over</i>] <i>the eye.</i> (K.)
One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَى عَيْنهِ ثِيرٌ</span> <i>Upon his eye is a covering</i>
[or <i>film</i>]. (TK.)

